	(text "1-2:\n  - AREF settes AVCC (5V) i firmware:\n     ADMUX = (1 << REFS0);\n  - Spenningsdeler til ADC (DREF) settes til 5V\n\n3-4: \n  - AREF og DREF settes til 2.5V fra LNM336"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.494 38.608 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Courier 10 Pitch")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7a0c0159-9fbd-47da-bf10-943531f13899")
	)
	(text "Tilsvarende som ovenfor,\nbruker mindre enn 10k resistor\nfor å få bedre nøyaktighet \nrundt 50-70 grader. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.792 109.982 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0668 1.0668)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "be9d9038-1875-405b-9431-b1d0519858ce")
	)
	(text "Runs 30 secs every 10th minute"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 75.946 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "cadfcf4a-1cd4-44c8-9963-500e6932b2fc")
	)
	(text "Thermistor resistans synker raskt over rom-temperatur,\nog vi primært interessert i temp > 50 grader. \nDa blir thermistor verdien langt under 100k,\nbruker derfor 47k istf 100k i divideren \n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.982 78.232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0668 1.0668)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "df59edcf-68df-418b-b051-bb3c43acec88")
	)
